# 📖 REFERENCE — Output Extensions

> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/reference/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/reference/output-extensions.ail`

---

## Crystallized Outputs (CAW layer)

```yaml
caw_outputs:
  - ext: ".wasm"
    name: "WebAssembly"
    target: "wasm32-unknown-unknown"
    signing: "Ed25519 (RNA)"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*", "gh:hugaalfatech/ros-go-olym"]
  - ext: ".so"
    name: "Shared Object (Linux)"
    target: "x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu"
    signing: "Ed25519 (RNA)"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*"]
  - ext: ".dll"
    name: "Dynamic Link Library (Windows)"
    target: "x86_64-pc-windows-msvc"
    signing: "Ed25519 (RNA)"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*"]
  - ext: ".dylib"
    name: "Dynamic Library (macOS)"
    target: "x86_64-apple-darwin"
    signing: "Ed25519 (RNA)"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*"]
  - ext: ".ae"
    name: "Artifact Executable"
    target: "Cosda runtime"
    signing: "ZES seal"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*"]
  - ext: ".amo"
    name: "Actor Module Object"
    target: "HA actor runtime"
    signing: "ZES seal + RNA"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*"]
  - ext: ".cap"
    name: "Crystallized Artifact Particle"
    target: "CAW output"
    signing: "CSA seal"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*", "caw:/minispace/ws-*/release/"]
  - ext: ".rco"
    name: "Runtime Callable Object"
    target: "RCO runtime"
    signing: "Ed25519 (RNA)"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*"]
  - ext: ".aso"
    name: "Authority Surface Object"
    target: "AVS surface"
    signing: "Authority + ZES"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*"]
  - ext: ".sio"
    name: "Stream IO Object"
    target: "Comet/HO network"
    signing: "Ed25519 (RNA)"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*"]
  - ext: ".ase"
    name: "Authority Sealed Executable"
    target: "Sealed bundle"
    signing: "CSA + Authority seal"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/*", "gh:hugaalfatech/ros-go-olym"]
```

## Workspace Final Products

```yaml
workspace_outputs:
  - ext: ".vsix"
    name: "VS Code Extension"
    target: "VS Code marketplace"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release", "marketplace.visualstudio.com"]
  - ext: ".msi"
    name: "Windows Installer"
    target: "Windows"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release"]
  - ext: ".exe"
    name: "Windows Executable"
    target: "Windows native"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release"]
  - ext: ".dmg"
    name: "macOS Disk Image"
    target: "macOS"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release"]
  - ext: ".AppImage"
    name: "Linux AppImage"
    target: "Linux portable"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release"]
  - ext: ".deb"
    name: "Debian Package"
    target: "Debian/Ubuntu"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release"]
  - ext: ".rpm"
    name: "Red Hat Package"
    target: "Fedora/RHEL"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release"]
  - ext: ".whl"
    name: "Python Wheel"
    target: "PyPI"
    distribution: ["PyPI", "gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release"]
  - ext: ".tgz"
    name: "Helm Chart"
    target: "Kubernetes"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release", "Helm registry"]
  - ext: ".tar.gz"
    name: "Generic Archive"
    target: "Universal"
    distribution: ["gh:cosda-dev/<workspace>-release"]
```

## Manifest Format (per artifact)

```yaml
manifest_template:
  name: "<artifact-name>"
  version: "<semver>"
  extension: "<.wasm | .so | ...>"
  hash:
    algorithm: "blake3"
    value: "<hash>"
  signed_by:
    key_id: "<key_id>"
    algorithm: "Ed25519"
    signature: "<signature>"
  sealed_by: "CSA / CEO"
  timestamp: "<iso8601>"
  source_layer: "<ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/c/>"
  distributed_to:
    - "gh:cosda-dev/<repo>"
    - "gh:hugaalfatech/ros-go-olym"
  dependencies: ["<dep1>", "<dep2>"]
  capabilities: ["<cap1>", "<cap2>"]
```

## Signing Command (RNA Ed25519)

```powershell
& t:/tools/sign/rna-sign.ps1 `
    -Input <artifact>.<ext> `
    -Key t:/keys/<key_id>.key `
    -Output <artifact>.<ext>.signed `
    -Manifest <artifact>.manifest.json
```

